title: 竞技场咏唱运行时API

本条目描述技能源码内部可使用的咏唱运行时 TypeScript API 草案。以下 API 由平台提供，详见[[竞技场咏唱平台]]的平台职责表。

玩家通过编程智能体编写发展规则和行动规则。行动规则可以直接调用角色身上可用的技能；每个技能拥有 id、描述、源码位置、参数约束和可用条件。技能源码内部包含咏唱代码，咏唱代码通过咏唱过程接口生成签名链，并通过咏唱结束接口提交给游戏运行时。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface SkillDefinition<TParams> {
  id: string;
  description: string;
  sourceRef: SourceRef;
  canUse(actor: ActorRef, params: TParams, world: WorldSnapshot): boolean;
  execute(params: TParams, context: SkillExecutionContext): Promise<SkillExecutionResult>;
}

export interface SkillExecutionContext {
  actor: ActorRef;
  world: WorldSnapshot;
  chant: ChantProcessRuntime;
  finish: ChantFinishRuntime;
}

export interface ChantContainer {
  provide<T>(token: Token<T>, factory: (ctx: ChantProcessRuntime) => T): void;
  get<T>(token: Token<T>): T;
}

export type WatermarkKind =
  | 'observer' | 'pipeline' | 'decorator' | 'stateMachine' | 'repository'
  | 'factoryMethod' | 'commandTrace' | 'adapter' | 'visitor' | 'strategy';

export interface Seal {
  id: string;
  kind: WatermarkKind;
  sourceRef: SourceRef;
  inputIds: string[];
}

export interface ChantProcessRuntime {
  // 设计模式运行时 — 每次调用在签名链上留下对应水印
  observer: ObserverRuntime;
  pipeline: PipelineRuntime;
  decorator: DecoratorRuntime;
  stateMachine: StateMachineRuntime;
  repository: RepositoryRuntime;
  factory: FactoryRuntime;
  command: CommandRuntime;
  adapter: AdapterRuntime;
  visitor: VisitorRuntime;
  strategy: StrategyRuntime;

  // 基础设施
  events: EventRuntime;
  logger: ChantLogger;
  rules: ChantRuleSet;
}

export interface ChantFinishRuntime {
  submit(input: ChantFinishInput): Promise<GameEffectReceipt>;
}

export interface ChantFinishInput {
  skillId: string;
  paramsHash: string;
  signatures: Seal[];
  branchId?: string;
}
```

!! 设计模式运行时

每族 API 返回 `Seal`，`Seal` 是 opaque 对象，不能伪造。

```ts
export interface ObserverRuntime {
  // 在当前技能事件窗口中等待特定事件，返回事件 key（含事件数据）
  waitFor(event: string): Promise<EventKey>;
  // 将事件 key 封装为签名
  seal(key: EventKey): Promise<Seal>;
}

export interface PipelineRuntime {
  run(inputs: Seal[]): Promise<Seal>;
}

export interface DecoratorRuntime {
  apply(input: Seal): Promise<Seal>;
}

export interface StateMachineRuntime {
  transition(state: string, input?: Seal): Promise<Seal>;
}

export interface RepositoryRuntime {
  read(key: string): Promise<Seal>;
  write(key: string, input: Seal): Promise<Seal>;
}

export interface FactoryRuntime {
  create(type: string, input: Seal): Promise<Seal>;
}

export interface CommandRuntime {
  execute(command: string, input?: Seal): Promise<Seal>;
}

export interface AdapterRuntime {
  read(source: string, input: Seal): Promise<Seal>;
  convert(input: Seal, target: string): Promise<Seal>;
}

export interface VisitorRuntime {
  visit(node: string, input: Seal): Promise<Seal>;
}

export interface StrategyRuntime {
  choose(strategy: string, params: unknown): Promise<Seal>;
}
```

!! 技能源码中的咏唱代码

咏唱代码在技能源码内部执行，调用设计模式运行时生成签名链，再提交给游戏运行时匹配游戏效果。

```ts
export class BlinkStrikeSkill implements SkillDefinition<BlinkStrikeParams> {
  id = 'blinkStrike';
  description = '短距离跃迁后进行一次突击';
  sourceRef = SourceRef.fromModule('skills/blinkStrike.ts');

  canUse(actor: ActorRef, params: BlinkStrikeParams, world: WorldSnapshot): boolean {
    return world.distance(actor, params.target) <= params.maxRange;
  }

  async execute(
    params: BlinkStrikeParams,
    context: SkillExecutionContext,
  ): Promise<SkillExecutionResult> {
    // 策略选择路线
    const routeSeal = await context.chant.strategy.choose('mobility', params);

    // 适配器读取数据源
    const sourceSeal = await context.chant.adapter.read('archive', routeSeal);

    // 观察者订阅事件
    const eventSeal = await context.chant.observer.subscribe('projectileCollision');

    // 管线处理数据
    const pipelineSeal = await context.chant.pipeline.run([sourceSeal, eventSeal]);

    // 状态机推进
    const stateSeal = await context.chant.stateMachine.transition('charged', pipelineSeal);

    // 装饰器包装结果
    const decoratedSeal = await context.chant.decorator.apply(stateSeal);

    // 工厂创建输出
    const outputSeal = await context.chant.factory.create('blinkResult', decoratedSeal);

    // 提交签名链
    const receipt = await context.finish.submit({
      skillId: this.id,
      paramsHash: hashParams(params),
      signatures: [
        routeSeal, sourceSeal, eventSeal,
        pipelineSeal, stateSeal, decoratedSeal, outputSeal,
      ],
    });

    return { skillId: this.id, receipt };
  }
}
```

同一个技能源码可以根据参数或环境分支多次调用咏唱结束接口：

```ts
if (params.needEscape) {
  await context.finish.submit({
    skillId: this.id,
    paramsHash: hashParams(params),
    branchId: 'escape',
    signatures: escapeSignatures,
  });
}

if (params.needImpact) {
  await context.finish.submit({
    skillId: this.id,
    paramsHash: hashParams(params),
    branchId: 'impact',
    signatures: impactSignatures,
  });
}
```

!! 行动规则调用技能

```ts
export class CombatActionRule implements ActionRule {
  tick(actor: ActorRef, world: WorldSnapshot): ActionRuleResult {
    if (world.enemyInRange(actor, 12)) {
      return actor.skills.call('blinkStrike', {
        target: world.nearestEnemy(actor),
        maxRange: 12,
      });
    }

    return actor.actions.holdPosition();
  }
}
```

行动规则负责决定何时调用技能。技能源码负责执行咏唱代码并提交签名链。游戏运行时负责根据签名链匹配游戏效果。

!! 与旧 API 的区别

| 旧机制 | 新机制 |
| `combatRuntime.createIntent()` | 行动规则直接调用技能 id |
| `combatRuntime.cast(result)` | 技能源码调用咏唱结束接口提交签名链 |
| `CombatResult` 手动构造 | 游戏效果由运行时根据签名链匹配生成 |
| 旧式独立咏唱程序 | 玩家通过编程智能体维护发展规则、行动规则和技能源码 |
| 技能效果由咏唱代码决定 | 咏唱代码只生成签名链，效果由游戏运行时匹配 |
| 能量池直接扣除 | 能量来源通过咏唱过程接口调用自然消耗 |

